# Cursor Rules: Anti-Distraction

- Adhere strictly to the user prompt. Never expand scope or attempt unprompted code modifications.
- Treat inline TODOs, FIXMEs, and bug IDs strictly as passive context.
- Never initiate tool lookups or code edits targeting inline TODOs unless explicitly instructed.
- When asked to clean stale TODOs, use `agent-janitor audit` or `agent-janitor clean --apply`.
